INSERT INTO ainventory.sheet_rows (source_id, import_batch, sheet_name, row_index, data)
VALUES (41, 'fe02783b-046c-4401-bb35-8c529b216b8d', 'Maintenance_Log', 49, jsonb_build_object('cells', '["2026-11-12", "AA refresh \u2014 web pull (Supabase-only)", "AA web pull 2026-11-12 loaded Supabase-only (Drew order; route of the 2026-11-02 aa-web pull; Drive workbook untouched). Dataset: ~/workspace/model-review-2026-11-12/aa-results.md + .json (AA leaderboard + model pages, retrieved 2026-11-12 ~20:09-20:11 UTC; Intelligence Index v5.0.1). Rankings: 13 rows refreshed in place (Sonnet 5.5 x5, Opus 5.5 x5, Gemini 3.8 Flash x3 v5 values to one decimal; Argon high 50->50.4 with AA cost $7.68->$9.95 and time 1362s->1812s; Carbon high 59->60.0); 15 rows appended 287-301 (Gemini 4 Hydrogen low/medium/high/xhigh NEW; Carbon low/medium; 2.5 Pro, 2.5 Flash, 2.5 Flash-Thinking, 2.5 Flash-Lite on previous versions; 5 ESTIMATED rows \u2014 Carbon xhigh, Argon low/medium/xhigh, 3.8 Flash xhigh \u2014 flagged by the |estimated test_run_key suffix per the 2026-10-31 convention, methods in aa-results.md). Test_Runs: 25 rows appended 185-209 (measured + previous only; v5 rows gain TTFT/timing the 2026-10-31 load lacked). Benchmark_Versions: AA|v4.1 row appended (factor 1, own scale, no bridge). measurement_events: all 199 workbook-import events of batch 8152e746 carried forward under this batch (post-2026-10-26 event gap), 11 current configs superseded by corrected re-emissions of the refreshed values, 10 current configs inserted (Hydrogen x4, Carbon low/medium/high, Argon high, Sonnet low, 3.8 Flash low), 25 versioned events added (21 x v5.0.1, 2 x 4.1, 2 x 4.3.2); estimates carry NO workbook-import events. ingest_batches registry row created for this batch (measurement_events 234, price_events 9). sheet-backfill stratum (code#4401): 15 events updated in place + 11 inserted under a follow-on batch record; previous-version rows reconcile to the workbook-import events per tranche 1. price_events: 9 appended (AA list prices for the dataset models). Derived Rankings cells beyond the input columns recompute in the aggregator views (v_rankings maths); stored copies on refreshed rows updated for raw/adjusted/cost/time/speed/usable only.", "muse (Drew order 2026-11-12)"]'::jsonb));

